      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Definitely more a bug than a feature request, IMO, but here we are more than two years later... so, bump!\n\nI have recently migrated *literally everything else* to Proton and now found it's disallowed by VRC. (Both @protonmail.com and @proton.me). \n\nCustomer support suggested - with a straight face and best intentions, I'm sure - to try making an account on another provider and use that. No thankyou :) Some other random account I make elsewhere is going to get lost, stolen or forgotten. Bad suggestion.\n\nThankyou :)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
