      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Shameless bump.\n\nthe fact proton email addresses are blocked is just dumb. Its been so long and proton mail is used by SO many people now, especially with gmail using your emails for ai by default (stinky google). I see no reason to continue blocking proton\n\nIts not just about being able to use that email address, its about actually having my mails be secure and not needing a separate account on a separate provider just for vrchat, even if i set up email forwarding. Stinky\n\nTo reiterate\n\nShameless bump.",
